  triage:title "boundary_enforcement.rs retirement-gate is a no-op stub for atm-core boundary records" ;
  triage:description "AI2-QA-1 (arch-qa + req-qa, same defect, D4). crates/atm-architecture/tests/boundary_enforcement.rs boundary-record-retirement checks (lines ~160-462) are a no-op stub for atm-core: boundary_module_sources() silently short-circuits because every boundaries/atm-core/*.toml record omits implementation.module (confirmed zero matches for rg 'module\\s*='). No assertion anywhere checks 'no live callers' or 'described as historical in docs' as sprint-ai-2.md Deliverable 4 requires. The cross-crate dependency-edge tests (runtime<->rusqlite, daemon<->rusqlite, etc.) are real and passing -- only the retirement-gate sub-feature is a stub. Confirmed present unchanged from AI.1 baseline through AI.3 (boundaries/atm-core/*.toml still has no implementation.module field on any worktree checked)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "QA" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
